 "read": "A study of Crush's idiom with the Charmtone palette (Charple #6B50FF, Dolly #FF60FF, Bok mint, Zest, Pepper bg): the ╱ diagonal as the brand signature in the header and every dialog title, a bold per-glyph gradient wordmark, ▌ focus bars that never shift content, filled pill buttons, inverse tag chips, toasts over the help line, the terminal background owned. Use it to calibrate against the reference, not as a product's theme: it is Charm's identity.",
